sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Retrieval as Retrieval Service
    participant Metadata as Metadata Store
    participant Vector as Vector Index
    participant Keyword as Keyword Index
    participant Reranker

    Client->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/retrieve
    Gateway->>Retrieval: tenant, principal, query, filters
    Retrieval->>Metadata: resolve principal ACL scope
    Metadata-->>Retrieval: allowed corpus + metadata predicates
    Retrieval->>Vector: ANN search with tenant and filters
    Retrieval->>Keyword: lexical search with same filters
    Vector-->>Retrieval: dense candidates
    Keyword-->>Retrieval: sparse candidates
    Retrieval->>Retrieval: blend, dedupe, validate ACL
    alt rerank enabled and budget available
        Retrieval->>Reranker: top candidates + query
        Reranker-->>Retrieval: reranked candidates
    end
    Retrieval-->>Gateway: cited chunks, scores, trace id
    Gateway-->>Client: retrieval response
